{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 15,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A soft answer turneth away wrath;\nBut a grievous word stirreth up anger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The tongue of the wise uttereth knowledge aright;\nBut the mouth of fools poureth out folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eyes of Jehovah are in every place,\nKeeping watch upon the evil and the good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A gentle tongue is a tree of life;\nBut perverseness therein is a breaking of the spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A fool despiseth his father’s correction;\nBut he that regardeth reproof getteth prudence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the house of the righteous is much treasure;\nBut in the revenues of the wicked is trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The lips of the wise disperse knowledge;\nBut the heart of the foolish ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "doeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not so.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sacrifice of the wicked is an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut the prayer of the upright is his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of the wicked is an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut he loveth him that followeth after righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is grievous correction for him that forsaketh the way;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that hateth reproof shall die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sheol and Abaddon are before Jehovah;\nHow much more then the hearts of the children of men!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A scoffer loveth not to be reproved;\nHe will not go unto the wise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A glad heart maketh a cheerful countenance;\nBut by sorrow of heart the spirit is broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The heart of him that hath understanding seeketh knowledge;\nBut the mouth of fools feedeth on folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the days of the afflicted are evil;\nBut he that is of a cheerful heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "hath",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a continual feast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better is little, with the fear of Jehovah,\nThan great treasure and trouble therewith.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better is a dinner of herbs, where love is,\nThan a stalled ox and hatred therewith.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wrathful man stirreth up contention;\nBut he that is slow to anger appeaseth strife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of the sluggard is as a hedge of thorns;\nBut the path of the upright is made a highway.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wise son maketh a glad father;\nBut a foolish man despiseth his mother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Folly is joy to him that is void of wisdom;\nBut a man of understanding maketh straight his going.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where there is no counsel, purposes are disappointed;\nBut in the multitude of counsellors they are established.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man hath joy in the answer of his mouth;\nAnd a word in due season, how good is it!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the wise the way of life ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "goeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upward,\nThat he may depart from Sheol beneath.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah will root up the house of the proud;\nBut he will establish the border of the widow.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil devices are an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut pleasant words ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is greedy of gain troubleth his own house;\nBut he that hateth bribes shall live.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The heart of the righteous studieth to answer;\nBut the mouth of the wicked poureth out evil things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is far from the wicked;\nBut he heareth the prayer of the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The light of the eyes rejoiceth the heart;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good tidings make the bones fat.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The ear that hearkeneth to the reproof of life\nShall abide among the wise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that refuseth correction despiseth his own soul;\nBut he that hearkeneth to reproof getteth understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.15.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.15.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah is the instruction of wisdom;\nAnd before honor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "goeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " humility.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
